# 1️⃣ Print Numbers from 1 to N

## 📖 Problem

Print numbers from **1 to N** using recursion.

---

### Example

```text
Input

5
```

Output

```text
1 2 3 4 5
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
void print(int n)
{
    if(n == 0)
        return;

    print(n - 1);

    cout << n << " ";
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(n)
```

### Space Complexity

```
O(n)
```

---

# 2️⃣ Print Numbers from N to 1

## 📖 Problem

Print numbers from **N to 1**.

---

### Example

```text
Input

5
```

Output

```text
5 4 3 2 1
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
void print(int n)
{
    if(n == 0)
        return;

    cout << n << " ";

    print(n - 1);
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(n)
```

