# 3️⃣ Sum of First N Numbers

## 📖 Problem

Find the sum of first N natural numbers.

---

### Example

```text
Input

5
```

Output

```text
15
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
int sum(int n)
{
    if(n == 0)
        return 0;

    return n + sum(n - 1);
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(n)
```

---

# 4️⃣ Factorial of a Number

## 📖 Problem

Find the factorial of a number.

---

### Formula

```text
n! = n × (n-1)!
```

---

### Example

```text
Input

5
```

Output

```text
120
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
int factorial(int n)
{
    if(n == 0 || n == 1)
        return 1;

    return n * factorial(n - 1);
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(n)
```

---

# 5️⃣ Fibonacci Series

## 📖 Problem

Find the Nth Fibonacci number.

---

### Formula

```text
F(n) = F(n-1) + F(n-2)
```

---

### Example

```text
Input

6
```

Output

```text
8
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
int fib(int n)
{
    if(n <= 1)
        return n;

    return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2);
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(2ⁿ)
```

### Space Complexity

```
O(n)
```

---

# 6️⃣ Power of a Number

## 📖 Problem

Calculate

```text
a^b
```

using recursion.

---

### Example

```text
Input

2 5
```

Output

```text
32
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
int power(int a, int b)
{
    if(b == 0)
        return 1;

    return a * power(a, b - 1);
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(b)
```

