# 7️⃣ Reverse an Array

## 📖 Problem

Reverse an array using recursion.

---

### Example

```text
Input

1 2 3 4 5
```

Output

```text
5 4 3 2 1
```

---

### Approach

Swap

```text
Left ↔ Right
```

Move both pointers toward the center.

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
void reverse(int arr[], int left, int right)
{
    if(left >= right)
        return;

    swap(arr[left], arr[right]);

    reverse(arr, left + 1, right - 1);
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(n)
```

---

# 8️⃣ Check Palindrome

## 📖 Problem

Determine whether a string is a palindrome.

---

### Example

```text
Input

MADAM
```

Output

```text
True
```

---

### Example

```text
Input

HELLO
```

Output

```text
False
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
bool palindrome(string s, int left, int right)
{
    if(left >= right)
        return true;

    if(s[left] != s[right])
        return false;

    return palindrome(s, left + 1, right - 1);
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(n)
```

