# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Always identify the Base Case first.

✅ Every recursive call should reduce the problem size.

✅ Trace recursive calls using a recursion tree.

✅ Avoid repeated calculations (like Fibonacci); use Dynamic Programming for optimization.

✅ Think about whether the function should **return a value** or simply **perform an action**.

